      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:ouvin3vruox2v2t674dym2c5/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxka2ff67s24",
      "text": "Leinster 22-5 Cardiff HT\nJust not good enough really.\nFar too many handling errors, everything being done a yard too slowly, and some of the tries have been seriously soft.\nEmpty the bench and look to score 3 tries.\n#LEIvCAR",
